# (AI-assisted) Klaww (ogre-start): the intro starts by itself, then ogreboss is forced through
# stage2, stage3 and die (pgo): ogreboss-dead, ogre-boss (task 86) at need-resolution (7, its cell
# to collect). Jak stands still.
#   OPENGOAL_NO_SOUND=1 OPENGOAL_PAD_SCRIPT=<this file> build-host-small/game/gk --proj-path <proj>
#     --config-path <scratch dir> --ctr-gfx -- -boot -fakeiso -nosound -cbackend
# (host small-memory C-mode gk running the p3ds modules; --config-path keeps the saves out of
# the user's OpenGOAL folder). Format and commands: game/sce/pad_script.h
0 wait *target* target-title-wait
200 log BOSS klaww
200 continue ogre-start
201 wait *target* target-continue
